haloUI
---
# Initialize local repository
```
repo init -u https://github.com/HaloUI-AOSP/android.git -b seventeen --git-lfs
```

# Sync up
```
repo sync -c -j$(nproc --all) --force-sync --no-clone-bundle --no-tags --optimized-fetch
```

# Build

- Set up the build environment
```bash
source build/envsetup.sh
```

- Lunch a target
```bash
breakfast codename
```

- To start compiling
```bash
m bacon
```

Build Flags:
---
- Face Unlock
```
TARGET_SUPPORTS_FACE_UNLOCK := true
```
- Animation fix for low-mid mtk devices
```
PERF_ANIM_OVERRIDE := true
```
- Use Kawase2 Blur Algorithm
```
TARGET_USES_KAWASE2_BLUR := true
```
- Disable PIHooks(For devices with fenrir)
```
TARGET_DISABLE_PIHOOKS := true 
```

